{"id":"025c5240f130d970","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-betti-numbers.md","title":"Betti Numbers","display":"df-betti-numbers — Betti Numbers","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-betti-numbers","aliases":["58-df-betti-numbers","Betti Numbers"],"display":"df-betti-numbers — Betti Numbers","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-dimension.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-betti-numbers"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-betti-numbers</span><span>Betti Numbers</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-betti-numbers — Betti Numbers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3537edf2017d84e\" href=\"?note=c3537edf2017d84e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md\">../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"522587a7fec6816a\" href=\"?note=522587a7fec6816a\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-dimension.md\">../batch09/58-df-dimension.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,+,d,\\odot\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\">\\(C,+,d,\\odot\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\mathcal H\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\mathcal H\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CycleGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CycleGroup}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S\\)</span> are from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c3537edf2017d84e\" href=\"?note=c3537edf2017d84e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md\">../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"522587a7fec6816a\" href=\"?note=522587a7fec6816a\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-dimension.md\">../batch09/58-df-dimension.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RationalChainComplex}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{RationalChainComplex}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomologyVectorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{HomologyVectorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BettiNumber}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{BettiNumber}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\operatorname{dom}(a),\\operatorname{ran}(a))\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\langle x,b\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(a)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(x,B,a)\\coloneqq\\{a(\\langle x,b\\rangle):b\\in B\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\operatorname{dom}(a),\\operatorname{ran}(a))\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\langle x,b\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(a)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(x,B,a)\\coloneqq\\{a(\\langle x,b\\rangle):b\\in B\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}betti\\text{-}numbers\\text{-}rational\\text{-}complex}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RationalChainComplex}_S(C,+,d,\\odot)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(C(q),\\mathbb Q,+(q),\\odot(q),\n+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},0_{\\mathbb Q},1_{\\mathbb Q})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\forall x\\in C(q)\\;\nd(q)\\bigl(\\odot(q)(\\langle r,x\\rangle)\\bigr)\n=\\odot(q-1)(\\langle r,d(q)(x)\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}betti\\text{-}numbers\\text{-}rational\\text{-}complex}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RationalChainComplex}_S(C,+,d,\\odot)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(C(q),\\mathbb Q,+(q),\\odot(q),\n+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},0_{\\mathbb Q},1_{\\mathbb Q})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\forall x\\in C(q)\\;\nd(q)\\bigl(\\odot(q)(\\langle r,x\\rangle)\\bigr)\n=\\odot(q-1)(\\langle r,d(q)(x)\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}betti\\text{-}numbers\\text{-}homology\\text{-}structure}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HomologyVectorStructure}_S(\\mathcal H,n,C,+,d,\\odot)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RationalChainComplex}_S(C,+,d,\\odot)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists Z,B,H,+_H,\\odot_H,0_H,z\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\nZ=\\mathrm{CycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\n\\land B=\\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}_S(n;C,d)\n\\land H=\\{\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(x,B,+(n)):x\\in Z\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n),+(n))\n\\land0_H=\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(z,B,+(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land+_H=\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(x,B,+(n)),\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(y,B,+(n))\\rangle,\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(+(n)(\\langle x,y\\rangle),B,+(n))\\rangle:x,y\\in Z\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\odot_H=\n\\{\\langle\\langle r,\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(x,B,+(n))\\rangle,\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(\\odot(n)(\\langle r,x\\rangle),B,+(n))\\rangle:r\\in\\mathbb Q,\\ x\\in Z\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(H,\\mathbb Q,+_H,\\odot_H,\n+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},0_{\\mathbb Q},1_{\\mathbb Q})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathcal H=\n\\langle H,\\mathbb Q,+_H,\\odot_H,+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},\n0_{\\mathbb Q},1_{\\mathbb Q},0_H\\rangle\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}betti\\text{-}numbers\\text{-}homology\\text{-}structure}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HomologyVectorStructure}_S(\\mathcal H,n,C,+,d,\\odot)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RationalChainComplex}_S(C,+,d,\\odot)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists Z,B,H,+_H,\\odot_H,0_H,z\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\nZ=\\mathrm{CycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\n\\land B=\\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}_S(n;C,d)\n\\land H=\\{\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(x,B,+(n)):x\\in Z\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n),+(n))\n\\land0_H=\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(z,B,+(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land+_H=\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(x,B,+(n)),\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(y,B,+(n))\\rangle,\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(+(n)(\\langle x,y\\rangle),B,+(n))\\rangle:x,y\\in Z\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\odot_H=\n\\{\\langle\\langle r,\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(x,B,+(n))\\rangle,\\mathrm{BettiCoset}_{58}(\\odot(n)(\\langle r,x\\rangle),B,+(n))\\rangle:r\\in\\mathbb Q,\\ x\\in Z\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(H,\\mathbb Q,+_H,\\odot_H,\n+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},0_{\\mathbb Q},1_{\\mathbb Q})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathcal H=\n\\langle H,\\mathbb Q,+_H,\\odot_H,+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},\n0_{\\mathbb Q},1_{\\mathbb Q},0_H\\rangle\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}betti\\text{-}numbers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BettiNumber}_S(\\kappa,n,C,+,d,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal H\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{HomologyVectorStructure}_S(\\mathcal H,n,C,+,d,\\odot)\n\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal H)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}betti\\text{-}numbers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BettiNumber}_S(\\kappa,n,C,+,d,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal H\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{HomologyVectorStructure}_S(\\mathcal H,n,C,+,d,\\odot)\n\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal H)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Betti numbers: ranks of homology groups</li>\n<li>The chain-group additions, rational scalar actions, quotient operations and encoded vector-space structure are explicit; the earlier two-place chain-complex call and unary <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim_{\\mathbb Q}\">\\(\\dim_{\\mathbb Q}\\)</span> operator had no compatible source.</li>\n<li>For a singular chain complex over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_0\">\\(b_0\\)</span> equals the number of path components.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_1\">\\(b_1\\)</span>: informally counts independent one-dimensional holes; formally it is the rank of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_1(X;\\mathbb Q)\">\\(H_1(X;\\mathbb Q)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_n\">\\(b_n\\)</span>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-dimensional voids</li>\n<li>Euler characteristic and the Poincare polynomial require additional finiteness hypotheses and are therefore not built into this definition.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Munkres, Elements of Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"c3537edf2017d84e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-dimension.md","status":"res